WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:15.240
Before you install: requirements, and choosing Light or Full. Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit; memory 8 GB (16 GB recommended); free disk space 10 GB.

2
00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:23.910
Graphics card: not needed; with a card that has 4 GB of memory or more, replies are several times faster.

3
00:00:24.456 --> 00:00:38.970
Internet: stable and always on, without a VPN (so messages arrive). Accounts: a professional Instagram page (Business or Creator), an old, active Facebook account; for Telegram, just a Telegram account.

4
00:00:39.524 --> 00:00:50.670
Both versions first check the computer and install only what that computer can use. The only difference is whether the AI models are in the package or downloaded during the install.

5
00:00:51.221 --> 00:01:02.530
Light, recommended for most: the app and tools are in the package; the models it needs are downloaded once, during the install, from their official source (internet needed).

6
00:01:03.076 --> 00:01:13.670
Full, for offline installs: everything is in the package: the app, the engines and the models. Best for on-site installs or slow connections.

